.TH OHGREAT 1
.SH NAME
ohgreat \- song and lyrics player
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/ohgreat
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I OhGreat
is a song and lyrics player.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Space starts and stops a fixed song while lyrics are shown.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Play/stop
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/ohgreat.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
